[ti:Joojeh Kebab]
[length:3:00]
[00:00.90]Hey, everybody!
[00:02.56]Forget the burgers, forget the fries!
[00:05.27]Tonight we’re making Persian chicken paradise!
[00:08.62]Get your saffron, grab your skewers…
[00:12.71]Let’s make some Joojeh Kebab!
[00:16.25]Two pounds of chicken, cut into squares,
[00:21.49]Boneless thighs or breasts, nobody cares!
[00:25.31]Two onions sliced, let the flavor flow,
[00:29.84]Add some yogurt if you like it slow.
[00:34.36]Fresh lemon juice, a little lime,
[00:36.91]Olive oil to make it shine!
[00:39.17]Salt and pepper, just a pinch,
[00:41.29]Turmeric too, for a golden finish!
[00:43.98]But wait a minute, here’s the key,
[00:46.67]Saffron water, strong and free!
[00:48.65]Crush those threads, add water hot,
[00:51.05]That’s the magic, that’s the spot!
[00:53.46]Joo-jeh! Joo-jeh!
[00:55.16]Golden chicken, come my way!
[00:57.42]Saffron shining, lemon bright,
[00:59.69]Persian chicken done just right!
[01:02.52]Joo-jeh! Joo-jeh!
[01:04.07]Let it marinate away!
[01:06.33]On the fire, smell that heat,
[01:08.46]Nothing beats this juicy treat!
[01:11.57]Mix it up and coat each piece,
[01:13.83]Let the flavors have their peace!
[01:16.09]Cover tight and chill all night,
[01:17.93]Four hours minimum works just right.
[01:20.20]Don’t rush the chicken, let it rest,
[01:22.46]That’s how you make the very best!
[01:24.59]Before the grill, shake off the sauce,
[01:26.99]Too much marinade can cause a loss!
[01:29.40]Take your skewers, slide them through,
[01:31.66]Leave a little space between each cube!
[01:33.92]Keep the pieces even in size,
[01:36.04]That’s how you get that perfect prize!
[01:38.59]Charcoal glowing, flames are low,
[01:40.71]Place the chicken, let it go!
[01:43.11]Turn it often, nice and slow,
[01:45.52]Golden edges start to show!
[01:47.49]Brush with butter, saffron too,
[01:49.89]Lemon butter coming through!
[01:51.87]Cook it fully, don’t guess the time,
[01:53.99]Seventy-four degrees that’s the line!
[01:56.66]Grilled tomatoes, side by side,
[01:58.78]Fresh green herbs and onions fried!
[02:01.31]Saffron rice, a little butter,
[02:03.57]Persian flavors, nothing better!
[02:05.82]Sumac sprinkled, lemon squeezed,
[02:08.07]Eat it hot, enjoy the feast!
[02:09.76]From Persian kitchens to the world,
[02:12.43]Joojeh Kebab, the golden bird!
[02:17.21]Joo-jeh! Joo-jeh!
[02:18.75]Golden chicken, hip hooray!
[02:20.99]Saffron, lemon, charcoal heat,
[02:23.23]Persian cooking can’t be beat!
[02:26.03]Joo-jeh! Joo-jeh!
[02:27.30]Bring your friends and come this way!
[02:29.68]Rice and butter, herbs so green,
[02:32.05]Best chicken you’ve ever seen!
[02:35.27]And remember, my friends…
[02:38.76]Saffron is gold, patience is key,
[02:41.70]And never serve raw chicken at your barbecue!
[02:46.17]Joojeh Kebab!
[02:48.83]That’s Persian magic!
[02:50.69]
